{"id":"n71577-2-8","stage":3,"title":"집중 · 集中","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71577-2-8-1","ko":"네가 자꾸 떠드니까 집중이 안 되잖아.","zh":"你一直吵个不停，我根本没法集中注意力啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"떠드니까","meaning":"大声说，嚷嚷","explanation":"떠들다：大声说，嚷嚷；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"떠들다","audio":"/audio/11ba432b1719e409c7da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64655","senseId":"2","lemma":"떠들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떠드니까","audio":"/audio/38303a9f0d091c8683d8.mp3"}},{"text":"집중이","meaning":"集中","explanation":"집중：集中；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"집중","audio":"/audio/2f4a31aaf5bcafa67a9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71577","senseId":"2","lemma":"집중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집중이","audio":"/audio/b96a79709d168feb824b.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"되잖아.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되잖아","audio":"/audio/58e5a9338380d12c9585.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"11ba432b1719e409","term":"떠들다","zh":"大声说，嚷嚷","audio":"/audio/11ba432b1719e409c7da.mp3","entryId":"64655","definition":"大声聊天或说话。","pronunciation":["떠ː들다"]},{"id":"2f4a31aaf5bcafa6","term":"집중","zh":"集中","audio":"/audio/2f4a31aaf5bcafa67a9f.mp3","entryId":"71577","definition":"为一件事倾注所有精力。","pronunciation":["집쭝"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/94a621cca024044f3b70.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71577-2-8-2","ko":"글 쓰시는 데 제가 방해가 됐네요. 죄송합니다.","zh":"打扰您写作了，实在抱歉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글","meaning":"文章","explanation":"글：文章","readings":[{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59226","senseId":"1","lemma":"글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰시는","meaning":"写，创作","explanation":"쓰다：写，创作；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰시는","audio":"/audio/a5584b858cf61f99fe8a.mp3"}},{"text":"데","meaning":"情况，状况。","explanation":"데：情况，状况。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI