":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"f06ff098a37b7817","term":"방해","zh":"妨碍，干扰","audio":"/audio/f06ff098a37b7817d7ff.mp3","entryId":"15489","definition":"干涉、阻碍事情的顺利进行。","pronunciation":["방해"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8a6793261797cb524847.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.805,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71577","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4584,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["打扰您写作了，实在抱歉。","香蕉还剩下好多，怎么办呢？","你一直吵个不停，我根本没法集中注意力啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["打扰您写作了，实在抱歉。","你一直吵个不停，我根本没法集中注意力啊。","香蕉还剩下好多，怎么办呢？"],"answer":0}]}
